# Lane B files

Follow `.agents/skills/lane-b-wikipedia/SKILL.md`.

- One extraction rule in TS and Python. Keep `.infobox` and `.hatnote`. Add `.noprint` in Python.
- Gate clicks with `candidates.has(title)`. `preventDefault` on every anchor.
- Article HTML from `action=parse&prop=text` only. Never `rest_v1/page/html`.
- Render `Candidate.index` verbatim. Never `enumerate(candidates, 1)`.
- Do not edit `gameStore` or `TimerBar`. Do not create `display.py` or `test_wiki.py`.
